# Nested Components & Composition Showcase

This example demonstrates component composition, slot forwarding, and nested component definitions in Zolto Phase 9.

---

## Component Definitions

component StatItem(label!, value!, trend="neutral")
card variant=trend
**{label}**
### {value}
end
end

component DashboardGrid(title="Executive Dashboard")
# {title}

slot top
end

slot main
end

slot footer
*Generated by Zolto Component Engine*
end
end

## Instantiation & Composition

DashboardGrid(title="Production Operations")

fill top
StatItem(label="Active Users", value="14,892", trend="success")
StatItem(label="Error Rate", value="0.01%", trend="success")
end

fill main
### System Metrics Overview

@chart spline title="Server Load (24h)"
labels: 00:00 06:00 12:00 18:00
data: 25 18 65 42
@/chart
end

end
